WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.264
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.534 --> 00:22.869
(Firefly Theater)

3
00:43.456 --> 00:47.392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

4
00:49.024 --> 00:52.608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

5
00:53.184 --> 00:55.520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

6
00:55.904 --> 00:58.656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

7
00:59.488 --> 01:02.080
♪I've seen this game before♪

8
01:02.080 --> 01:04.768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

9
01:04.768 --> 01:07.168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

10
01:07.552 --> 01:10.304
♪Just an empty shell♪

11
01:10.624 --> 01:13.440
♪I've broken this game before♪

12
01:13.440 --> 01:15.872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

13
01:15.872 --> 01:18.016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

14
01:18.208 --> 01:25.056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

15
01:25.728 --> 01:28.256
♪When I stand back up again♪

16
01:28.544 --> 01:30.400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

17
01:31.264 --> 01:33.952
♪For the part you owe me♪

18
01:34.112 --> 01:41.088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

19
01:42.624 --> 01:47.360
♪You're just my starting point♪

20
01:51.712 --> 01:52.739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

21
01:53.192 --> 01:55.752
=Episode 4=

22
01:58.180 --> 01:59.340
(No updates in 24 hours) The folks in the chat

23
01:59.740 --> 02:00.941
(Is Lucky Beauty Yu missing?) ask me to check Lucky Beauty Yu.

24
02:00.941 --> 02:01.540
(Lucky Beauty Yu acting weird)

25
02:01.540 --> 02:02.540
(Baibai Liu) They said something happened.

26
02:02.701 --> 02:03.501
Her fate unknown.

27
02:03.501 --> 02:04.980
- Her injury doesn't look accidental. - Involving Beauty Yu too.

28
02:04.980 --> 02:05.460
(Check Lucky Beauty Yu) Really?

29
02:05.460 --> 02:06.141
- It looks like... - It's confirmed?

30
02:06.340 --> 02:07.421
(That's terrifying) Something happened to Lucky Beauty Yu.

31
02:07.421 --> 02:08.296
(Strolling Painter joined the stream)

32
02:08.740 --> 02:09.620
(Communities discussing Lucky Beauty Yu) Is this for real?

33
02:09.900 --> 02:10.900
(Lucky Beauty Yu missing) The boss lady is missing,

34
02:10.940 --> 02:11.861
causing such a scene.

35
02:11.861 --> 02:13.141
(Heard it might be abuse)

36
02:13.141 --> 02:14.021
Not abuse, right?

37
02:21.460 --> 02:22.101
Meng,

38
02:23.101 --> 02:24.780
I brought your favorite stuffed rice cakes

39
02:25.541 --> 02:26.180
right at your

40
02:26.180 --> 02:27.101
high school gate.

41
02:31.740 --> 02:32.261
Meng,

42
02:36.340 --> 02:37.060
I promise

43
02:37.541 --> 02:39.141
I won't drink while trying to conceive.

44
02:39.780 --> 02:41.381
I swear on my life.

45
02:42.021 --> 02:42.861
- Sir. - Meng.

46
02:43.581 --> 02:44.141
Sir,

47
02:44.460 --> 02:45.660
how can I help you?

48
02:46.101 --> 02:46.660
Well,

49
02:46.780 --> 02:48.021
my wife is in this room.

50
02:48.141 --> 02:49.220
Could you open the door?

51
02:50.141 --> 02:51.340
Well, I'm afraid...

52
02:53.261 --> 02:53.940
My wife and I

53
02:53.940 --> 02:54.740
have our calendars

54
02:54.821 --> 02:55.541
synced up.

55
02:58.060 --> 02:58.541
Look.

56
02:59.180 --> 03:00.301
(7:00 PM, Anlan B&amp;B, Room 5105, Yu Meng) She booked this room.

57
03:01.581 --> 03:03.220
Please wait a moment. Let me check.

58
03:07.301 --> 03:08.500
Room 5105...

59
03:09.381 --> 03:10.220
It's unoccupied.

60
03:10.940 --> 03:11.581
Impossible.

61
03:29.500 --> 03:30.421
If one day,

62
03:31.861 --> 03:33.541
I disappear from the public eye,

63
03:35.381 --> 03:37.141
it must be because of my husband,

64
03:39.101 --> 03:40.101
Di Liren.

65
03:53.660 --> 03:54.541
I think I know

66
03:54.581 --> 03:56.220
what Meng's vanishing is about.

67
03:56.701 --> 03:57.381
How about

68
03:57.701 --> 03:58.780
we meet and talk?

69
04:01.660 --> 04:02.421
Where are you now?

70
04:02.581 --> 04:03.220
Be right there.

71
04:07.701 --> 04:08.340
Remember the one

72
04:08.340 --> 04:09.421
who put the photos of you

73
04:09.500 --> 04:10.180
and Chen Chen

74
04:10.180 --> 04:11.141
into Meng's bouquet?

75
04:11.981 --> 04:12.701
Meng found

76
04:12.701 --> 04:14.261
she probably lives in Yujing Garden.

77
04:15.500 --> 04:16.300
How do you know?

78
04:16.581 --> 04:17.621
Meng told me.

79
04:18.061 --> 04:19.501
She even sent Meng a threat,

80
04:19.581 --> 04:20.540
forcing her to divorce,

81
04:21.300 --> 04:22.501
and demanded to meet.

82
04:23.900 --> 04:25.300
Forcing Meng to divorce me?

83
04:26.300 --> 04:27.621
What is she really after?

84
04:28.181 --> 04:28.900
When?

85
04:29.460 --> 04:30.860
Meng only told me yesterday.

86
04:31.660 --> 04:33.300
She was sad and couldn't stop crying.

87
04:34.340 --> 04:35.460
I asked what her plan was.

88
04:36.300 --> 04:37.061
She said she wanted

89
04:37.100 --> 04:37.860
to stay with you,

90
04:38.621 --> 04:39.540
so she planned

91
04:39.581 --> 04:40.261
to talk it out.

92
04:40.741 --> 04:41.540
Know the exact time

93
04:41.540 --> 04:42.181
and place?

94
04:42.821 --> 04:43.501
I don't.

95
04:43.501 --> 04:44.701
Meng didn't tell me.

96
04:44.980 --> 04:45.780
After saying that,

97
04:45.821 --> 04:46.980
she went there alone.

98
04:47.581 --> 04:49.061
There's been no word from her since.

99
04:49.701 --> 04:51.021
If it's like you thought,

100
04:51.540 --> 04:52.220
Meng's vanishing

101
04:52.220 --> 04:53.340
is connected to this person,

102
04:53.821 --> 04:54.621
she'll definitely

103
04:54.621 --> 04:55.381
make another move.

104
04:57.501 --> 04:58.701
Now, she's in the shadows,

105
04:58.780 --> 04:59.621
and we're exposed.

106
05:00.741 --> 05:02.181
Any move we make will backfire.

107
05:02.980 --> 05:04.581
We have to wait for her to move first.

108
05:04.980 --> 05:05.821
See what she wants.

109
05:07.261 --> 05:08.420
Will that really work?

110
05:09.420 --> 05:10.460
What you suspect

111
05:10.621 --> 05:11.660
is just speculation

112
05:11.821 --> 05:12.420
without proof.

113
05:13.821 --> 05:14.821
The time Meng's been gone

114
05:14.900 --> 05:15.980
doesn't qualify as a case.

115
05:17.420 --> 05:18.941
If we leak word now,

116
05:19.741 --> 05:20.860
we'll easily tip her off,

117
05:22.141 --> 05:24.220
which could put Meng in danger.

118
05:26.621 --> 05:27.460
You have a point.

119
05:29.561 --> 05:30.220
How about this?

120
05:31.021 --> 05:31.660
I'll go check

121
05:31.660 --> 05:32.860
places Meng usually visits.

122
05:33.460 --> 05:34.021
Okay.

123
05:42.021 --> 05:42.701
(He's coming out)

124
05:42.860 --> 05:43.340
(Follow him)

125
05:44.501 --> 05:44.980
(Liu Bai) Okay.

126
05:47.021 --> 05:47.821
I told Di Liren

127
05:47.900 --> 05:48.941
everything you said.

128
05:49.001 --> 05:49.540
As expected,

129
05:49.660 --> 05:50.741
his face changed,

130
05:51.021 --> 05:52.220
and he rushed straight out.

131
05:52.741 --> 05:53.501
He should do

132
05:53.540 --> 05:54.381
as we said

133
05:54.540 --> 05:55.780
and question that person.

134
05:59.100 --> 06:00.061
Let's hope so.

135
06:00.621 --> 06:01.420
But

136
06:01.660 --> 06:03.340
if he really goes to see that person

137
06:03.420 --> 06:04.941
and they compare notes,

138
06:05.181 --> 06:05.621
won't they

139
06:05.621 --> 06:06.900
realize we framed him?

140
06:07.381 --> 06:08.381
Will he suspect us?

141
06:11.780 --> 06:13.381
Since that person sent me photos

142
06:13.501 --> 06:14.621
behind Di Liren's back,

143
06:15.181 --> 06:16.540
it means

144
06:16.860 --> 06:18.660
there's already a rift between them.

145
06:19.181 --> 06:20.420
There's not much trust left.

146
06:56.840 --> 06:58.952
(Liu Bai)

147
07:00.621 --> 07:01.061
Speak.

148
07:02.061 --> 07:02.701
He got off.

149
07:02.780 --> 07:03.501
Went into a house.

150
07:03.701 --> 07:04.540
I'll send you photos.

151
07:11.181 --> 07:12.460
Isn't this your parents' house?

152
07:14.021 --> 07:14.540
Liren,

153
07:15.100 --> 07:16.741
what did Meng mean in that video?

154
07:17.501 --> 07:19.300
What does she mean, if she disappears,

155
07:19.581 --> 07:20.621
it's all because of you?

156
07:21.181 --> 07:21.941
Here's the thing.

157
07:22.220 --> 07:23.181
Someone played a prank

158
07:23.741 --> 07:24.821
and sent Meng photos,

159
07:25.860 --> 07:26.941
saying that I had an affair

160
07:27.061 --> 07:28.192
with my assistant Chen Chen.

161
07:28.581 --> 07:29.261
In fact,

162
07:29.261 --> 07:30.621
Chen Chen has a boyfriend.

163
07:31.061 --> 07:32.181
I introduced Meng to him.

164
07:32.460 --> 07:33.941
I thought this was behind us,

165
07:35.021 --> 07:36.501
but according to Liu Zi,

166
07:38.141 --> 07:39.141
Meng was still sulking,

167
07:39.542 --> 07:40.220
saying I didn't

168
07:40.220 --> 07:41.261
care about her feelings.

169
07:41.660 --> 07:43.141
So she claimed her vanishing

170
07:44.660 --> 07:45.540
would be my fault.

171
07:46.300 --> 07:47.181
Lizhen,

172
07:47.741 --> 07:48.860
don't get so worked up.

173
07:49.701 --> 07:50.941
After all,

174
07:51.581 --> 07:53.261
Meng got her temper

175
07:53.340 --> 07:54.540
from you.

176
07:55.420 --> 07:56.581
Meng is a bit spoiled

177
07:56.660 --> 07:57.381
and dramatic,

178
07:57.941 --> 07:59.340
but she's my only daughter.

179
07:59.340 --> 08:00.381
I can afford to spoil her.

180
08:00.746 --> 08:01.460
But she must have

181
08:01.460 --> 08:02.780
a reason for acting up with you.

182
08:03.420 --> 08:04.300
If you had handled

183
08:04.300 --> 08:05.381
workplace boundaries well

184
08:05.581 --> 08:06.821
and stopped the rumors,

185
08:07.340 --> 08:08.061
would she

186
08:08.061 --> 08:08.860
cause such a scene?

187
08:09.460 --> 08:10.220
In the end,

188
08:10.621 --> 08:11.501
it's still your fault.

189
08:13.540 --> 08:14.141
Mom,

190
08:15.021 --> 08:15.860
you're right.

191
08:16.261 --> 08:17.100
Once I find Meng,

192
08:17.381 --> 08:18.460
I'll apologize properly

193
08:18.581 --> 08:19.621
and bring her back safely.

194
08:20.501 --> 08:21.220
Please calm down.

195
08:28.261 --> 08:28.941
Liren,

196
08:29.900 --> 08:31.021
no offense,

197
08:31.381 --> 08:33.101
but you should manage your marriage

198
08:33.381 --> 08:34.300
just as diligently

199
08:34.300 --> 08:35.621
as you do your work.

200
08:35.981 --> 08:37.420
It's an art in itself.

201
08:38.021 --> 08:39.101
You need to master it.

202
08:40.420 --> 08:42.141
If you don't have enough energy,

203
08:42.461 --> 08:44.180
I can return to the company to help you.

204
08:44.981 --> 08:45.501
Dad,

205
08:45.940 --> 08:46.940
I've learned my lesson.

206
08:47.381 --> 08:49.101
From now on, Meng will always come first.

207
08:49.420 --> 08:50.141
All right.

208
08:50.580 --> 08:51.780
Meng is fine now,

209
08:51.780 --> 08:52.820
so you can rest easy now.

210
08:53.101 --> 08:54.540
He was worried all night

211
08:55.180 --> 08:56.540
and didn't eat anything.

212
08:59.461 --> 09:00.300
That won't do.

213
09:01.780 --> 09:02.381
Ms. Hui.

214
09:03.540 --> 09:04.741
Get something to eat now.

215
09:05.820 --> 09:06.381
Just a moment.

216
09:07.021 --> 09:07.580
Mr. Yu.

217
09:08.341 --> 09:09.420
Let me check the size.

218
09:09.820 --> 09:10.741
It's all knitted?

219
09:11.621 --> 09:12.381
Lizhen,

220
09:12.780 --> 09:13.900
when people get old,

221
09:14.300 --> 09:15.580
their blood vessels just shrink.

222
09:16.060 --> 09:17.261
Store-bought socks

223
09:17.261 --> 09:18.141
are too tight.

224
09:18.540 --> 09:20.021
After seeing that,

225
09:20.101 --> 09:20.820
Hui volunteered,

226
09:20.900 --> 09:22.300
saying she would knit

227
09:22.621 --> 09:23.180
all my socks.

228
09:23.660 --> 09:24.621
These past few days,

229
09:24.780 --> 09:26.621
worrying about Meng

230
09:26.621 --> 09:28.221
has made me restless.

231
09:28.300 --> 09:29.700
It was Hui

232
09:30.660 --> 09:31.981
who kept comforting me.

233
09:35.501 --> 09:36.300
Otherwise,

234
09:36.381 --> 09:37.660
my blood pressure would've

235
09:37.940 --> 09:39.141
shot through the roof.

236
09:43.621 --> 09:44.741
She's already walked away.

237
09:45.060 --> 09:45.900
Still staring?

238
09:49.101 --> 09:50.381
What are you doing?

239
09:50.820 --> 09:52.261
I'm just being grateful.

240
09:59.461 --> 10:00.180
Look at how guilty

241
10:00.221 --> 10:01.540
he looks.

242
10:02.420 --> 10:04.060
If he didn't have dirty intentions,

243
10:04.580 --> 10:05.660
why did he run off?

244
10:06.540 --> 10:07.141
Mom,

245
10:07.500 --> 10:08.430
you're overthinking it.

246
10:08.981 --> 10:09.420
Look.

247
10:09.820 --> 10:10.180
I'll go

248
10:10.180 --> 10:11.341
give Ms. Hui a hand,

249
10:11.940 --> 10:13.461
and have her make Dad some fish soup

250
10:13.621 --> 10:14.300
to nourish him.

251
10:15.300 --> 10:15.981
Please calm down.

252
10:32.300 --> 10:32.861
Ms. Hui,

253
10:33.101 --> 10:34.300
let me wash the vegetables.

254
10:47.461 --> 10:49.141
You put those photos in the flowers?

255
10:52.981 --> 10:53.540
Why?

256
10:54.771 --> 10:56.053
In case you forget what matters.

257
10:57.501 --> 10:58.580
I'd never forget.

258
11:00.141 --> 11:00.900
Wait a bit longer.

259
11:02.660 --> 11:03.580
I've been waiting.

260
11:05.501 --> 11:06.261
So,

261
11:06.580 --> 11:07.540
where is Meng?

262
11:10.900 --> 11:11.900
You think I know?

263
11:13.381 --> 11:14.420
Who told you anything?

264
11:16.021 --> 11:17.221
Liu Zi told me

265
11:17.660 --> 11:18.501
Meng found out

266
11:18.501 --> 11:20.141
who put the photos in the flowers,

267
11:20.741 --> 11:21.900
went to confront her,

268
11:22.180 --> 11:23.180
and then went missing.

269
11:23.940 --> 11:25.021
Liu Zi is her best friend.

270
11:25.381 --> 11:26.420
They share all secrets.

271
11:29.700 --> 11:30.900
Are you saying

272
11:31.461 --> 11:32.900
Yu Meng told Liu Zi to say that?

273
11:34.501 --> 11:35.501
You need to be careful.

274
11:35.900 --> 11:36.940
Right after she vanished,

275
11:37.300 --> 11:38.780
the internet went wild,

276
11:39.141 --> 11:40.540
insinuating that you killed her.

277
11:40.900 --> 11:42.180
She's just a minor influencer.

278
11:42.900 --> 11:44.222
Does she have such a huge impact?

279
11:44.700 --> 11:46.261
Someone must be pulling the strings.

280
11:47.341 --> 11:48.461
We both need to be careful.

281
11:50.621 --> 11:51.820
Find Yu Meng, end this fast,

282
11:51.820 --> 11:52.700
and divorce her.

283
11:54.780 --> 11:56.060
If she's hiding herself from me,

284
11:56.461 --> 11:57.540
she won't be easy to find.

285
12:00.700 --> 12:01.501
Be patient.

286
12:02.741 --> 12:04.180
Find a way to make her show herself.

287
12:16.456 --> 12:17.352
(Liu Bai)

288
12:17.621 --> 12:18.101
How is it?

289
12:18.300 --> 12:18.700
Sis,

290
12:19.060 --> 12:20.540
since yesterday, he returned

291
12:20.540 --> 12:21.621
from Meng's parents' house,

292
12:21.940 --> 12:22.621
he's been normal.

293
12:23.060 --> 12:23.900
He just went to work

294
12:24.180 --> 12:24.900
and didn't meet

295
12:24.940 --> 12:25.780
with anyone strange.

296
12:25.900 --> 12:27.021
You must have been exposed.

297
12:28.141 --> 12:28.660
I am

298
12:28.660 --> 12:29.820
one hundred percent sure

299
12:30.101 --> 12:30.540
I didn't.

300
12:31.820 --> 12:32.501
He's heading out.

301
12:32.501 --> 12:33.141
I'll follow him.

302
12:33.261 --> 12:33.741
Gotta go.

303
12:35.501 --> 12:36.141
What do we do?

304
12:36.180 --> 12:37.021
Waiting like this

305
12:37.021 --> 12:37.900
won't work.

306
12:38.221 --> 12:40.060
Jiao Xu told me before

307
12:40.940 --> 12:42.540
that value fluctuations in collectibles

308
12:42.540 --> 12:43.540
are unpredictable.

309
12:45.021 --> 12:46.660
Since his only physical investment

310
12:46.660 --> 12:48.180
right now is the art gallery,

311
12:49.420 --> 12:50.621
let's start with that.

312
12:50.820 --> 12:51.700
So what's your plan?

313
12:52.060 --> 12:53.420
Say it in front of everyone.

314
12:54.341 --> 12:55.621
How dare your gallery

315
12:55.660 --> 12:57.101
sell me this painting for 3 million?

316
12:57.660 --> 12:58.861
Not even worth 30 thousand!

317
12:59.700 --> 13:00.180
Refund!

318
13:01.341 --> 13:01.900
Mr. Wang,

319
13:02.141 --> 13:04.101
artwork is non-refundable and non-exchangeable.

320
13:04.540 --> 13:06.300
This painting isn't worth this much.

321
13:07.060 --> 13:07.820
When I was abroad,

322
13:08.101 --> 13:09.141
I saw this artist's work

323
13:09.141 --> 13:09.940
go up for auction.

324
13:11.021 --> 13:12.580
The highest bid on any piece

325
13:12.820 --> 13:13.780
was 20 thousand yuan.

326
13:14.381 --> 13:15.660
In your gallery,

327
13:15.741 --> 13:17.060
you marked it up a hundred times!

328
13:17.820 --> 13:18.540
This is nothing

329
13:18.580 --> 13:19.861
but an outright scam!

330
13:20.780 --> 13:21.981
Let's just go somewhere else.

331
13:22.180 --> 13:22.660
Yeah.

332
13:22.820 --> 13:24.580
Everyone wants to make money,

333
13:24.820 --> 13:25.940
but this is way too greedy.

334
13:25.940 --> 13:26.660
Let's go.

335
13:29.940 --> 13:30.540
Mr. Wang,

336
13:30.780 --> 13:31.381
I am so sorry

337
13:31.461 --> 13:31.940
for your

338
13:31.940 --> 13:32.900
unpleasant experience.

339
13:33.300 --> 13:34.660
I heard what you said.

340
13:35.300 --> 13:37.021
Paying 3 million for a painting

341
13:37.461 --> 13:38.141
proves you're

342
13:38.141 --> 13:39.501
a collector with exquisite taste.

343
13:39.820 --> 13:41.780
You must know that value fluctuates,

344
13:42.141 --> 13:43.540
but personal passion is priceless.

345
13:43.900 --> 13:44.741
If you like it,

346
13:45.021 --> 13:46.221
then it's worth every penny.

347
13:46.530 --> 13:47.141
In other words,

348
13:47.141 --> 13:48.141
if you don't like it,

349
13:48.341 --> 13:49.261
even a rare masterpiece

350
13:49.261 --> 13:49.780
would be

351
13:49.820 --> 13:50.900
totally worthless to you.

352
13:51.180 --> 13:52.300
Spare me the lecture.

353
13:52.780 --> 13:53.940
Since you're the manager,

354
13:54.381 --> 13:55.021
just tell me

355
13:55.141 --> 13:55.700
refund

356
13:55.981 --> 13:56.780
or not?

357
13:57.300 --> 13:57.820
I'm sorry.

358
13:58.261 --> 13:58.940
It's final.

359
13:59.180 --> 13:59.940
No refunds.

360
14:01.861 --> 14:02.501
Fine.

361
14:03.180 --> 14:04.981
Mark my words.

362
14:05.341 --> 14:06.261
I will expose

363
14:06.780 --> 14:08.021
your shady shop online.

364
14:08.060 --> 14:08.981
I'll have netizens

365
14:09.101 --> 14:10.420
tear this place apart

366
14:10.621 --> 14:11.780
down to every dirty detail.

367
14:12.341 --> 14:13.461
Your gallery

368
14:13.580 --> 14:15.420
won't make another dime.

369
14:15.741 --> 14:16.700
Just wait to shut down.

370
14:31.621 --> 14:32.381
Hello, Mr. Di.

371
14:34.300 --> 14:35.540
Let him refund the painting.

372
14:36.221 --> 14:37.660
We paid out the previous cut.

373
14:38.060 --> 14:39.461
If we issue a full refund now,

374
14:39.540 --> 14:40.341
we'll lose big.

375
14:40.981 --> 14:42.341
We can't let him make a scene.

376
14:42.820 --> 14:43.780
If he finds out

377
14:44.021 --> 14:45.420
I'm the owner behind the gallery,

378
14:45.540 --> 14:46.461
it'll be even worse.

379
14:48.461 --> 14:49.300
Besides,

380
14:49.300 --> 14:50.101
It's a critical stage

381
14:50.101 --> 14:51.381
for Jiali's new product launch.

382
14:51.940 --> 14:53.580
Yu Meng's disappearance has already

383
14:54.021 --> 14:55.580
disrupted the product rollout.

384
14:56.221 --> 14:57.580
We can't afford any more problems.

385
14:57.700 --> 14:58.580
But the gallery

386
14:58.580 --> 14:59.341
is out of funds.

387
14:59.861 --> 15:00.741
I'll handle it.

388
15:01.461 --> 15:01.981
Besides,

389
15:02.900 --> 15:04.461
check who referred him.

390
15:05.180 --> 15:06.141
Blacklist them.

391
15:06.700 --> 15:07.141
Okay.

392
15:13.461 --> 15:14.221
Mr. Long,

393
15:15.021 --> 15:15.700
I'd like to turn

394
15:15.700 --> 15:16.461
my 3 million deposit

395
15:16.461 --> 15:17.540
from February

396
15:17.660 --> 15:18.461
into a check.

397
15:19.624 --> 15:22.184
(Bank)

398
15:37.501 --> 15:38.741
Exposing Di Liren's gallery,

399
15:38.820 --> 15:40.461
pushing buyers to demand their rights,

400
15:40.900 --> 15:41.660
forcing Di Liren

401
15:41.660 --> 15:42.660
to use his slush fund.

402
15:42.981 --> 15:43.420
Seriously,

403
15:43.580 --> 15:44.741
you really know your stuff.

404
15:44.900 --> 15:45.580
For all the money

405
15:45.700 --> 15:46.741
he took from me,

406
15:47.060 --> 15:48.780
I'll make him pay back in full.

407
15:50.221 --> 15:51.180
That's 3 million!

408
15:51.580 --> 15:53.141
He took it all

409
15:53.420 --> 15:54.501
without hesitation.

410
15:55.660 --> 15:56.820
Look on the bright side.

411
15:57.221 --> 15:58.381
Moving such a large sum

412
15:58.461 --> 15:59.741
must cause internal friction.

413
16:00.021 --> 16:00.820
Let's see if we can

414
16:00.900 --> 16:01.981
lure out the big fish

415
16:01.981 --> 16:02.580
behind him.

416
16:03.700 --> 16:04.101
Come on.

417
16:05.101 --> 16:05.900
You're right.

418
16:06.540 --> 16:07.940
I'll take Di Liren down

419
16:08.461 --> 16:09.261
in one go.

420
16:12.101 --> 16:12.861
Let me take this.

421
16:21.461 --> 16:22.861
Since the check was canceled,

422
16:23.381 --> 16:24.621
you should tell me immediately!

423
16:25.180 --> 16:25.700
Sorry.

424
16:28.660 --> 16:29.501
Great!

425
16:30.861 --> 16:31.501
Bullseye!

426
16:42.101 --> 16:43.060
You canceled my check?

427
16:43.501 --> 16:44.700
That is our check.

428
16:47.141 --> 16:48.900
Something happened at the gallery.

429
16:49.180 --> 16:50.300
(Recording) Someone demanded a refund.

430
16:50.820 --> 16:51.540
I figured

431
16:51.981 --> 16:52.981
I'd just pay him off

432
16:53.381 --> 16:54.381
before he makes a scene

433
16:54.420 --> 16:55.660
and drags me into it.

434
16:56.141 --> 16:56.780
Gallery shares

435
16:56.780 --> 16:57.621
are nominee-held,

436
16:58.180 --> 16:58.660
and you're

437
16:58.660 --> 16:59.621
not the legal rep.

438
17:00.261 --> 17:01.060
Regular disputes

439
17:01.060 --> 17:01.940
won't lead to you.

440
17:02.861 --> 17:04.021
The gallery has to stay open.

441
17:04.901 --> 17:05.901
I just closed a deal

442
17:05.901 --> 17:06.580
a few days ago.

443
17:07.021 --> 17:08.661
We'll definitely make more in the future.

444
17:09.380 --> 17:10.461
I want to secure our future

445
17:10.461 --> 17:11.340
a bit more.

446
17:11.901 --> 17:12.981
What we have now is enough.

447
17:13.140 --> 17:14.421
I want to give you the best.

448
17:14.780 --> 17:15.701
I'm not that greedy.

449
17:16.461 --> 17:17.261
I'm content.

450
17:17.661 --> 17:19.140
So now you think I'm greedy?

451
17:19.340 --> 17:20.421
I think your ambition

452
17:20.981 --> 17:22.380
goes far beyond what you claimed.

453
17:23.860 --> 17:25.340
Are you actually soft on her?

454
17:26.100 --> 17:26.981
For you,

455
17:27.540 --> 17:29.221
I never let her get pregnant.

456
17:29.780 --> 17:31.261
Doesn't that speak for my heart?

457
17:32.820 --> 17:34.501
Didn't we agree before

458
17:34.820 --> 17:35.981
that we're in this together?

459
17:36.620 --> 17:37.380
Besides,

460
17:38.100 --> 17:39.741
my money will be cleared soon.

461
17:40.300 --> 17:41.300
(Recording) When the time comes, I'll return

462
17:41.300 --> 17:42.780
the 3 million with full interest.

463
17:43.421 --> 17:44.221
I promise

464
17:44.540 --> 17:46.421
my commitments to you won't change.

465
17:47.261 --> 17:48.661
I found an overseas institution.

466
17:48.981 --> 17:49.941
The money's transferred.

467
17:51.261 --> 17:52.981
A minor gallery issue is nothing to you.

468
17:53.820 --> 17:54.661
I believe in you.

469
18:10.580 --> 18:11.261
Mr. Zhou,

470
18:12.100 --> 18:13.221
any extra cash lately?

471
18:13.941 --> 18:15.060
Lend me some for cash flow.

472
18:20.100 --> 18:20.860
For you,

473
18:21.221 --> 18:22.981
I never let her get pregnant.

474
18:23.501 --> 18:24.901
Doesn't that speak for my heart?

475
18:31.060 --> 18:31.901
So that means

476
18:33.100 --> 18:34.300
all the medication I took,

477
18:34.860 --> 18:35.580
all the suffering

478
18:36.461 --> 18:37.140
and injections

479
18:37.620 --> 18:38.540
were all for nothing?

480
18:39.300 --> 18:39.860
Yes.

481
18:40.941 --> 18:42.261
I suffered so much.

482
18:42.981 --> 18:43.661
I always thought

483
18:43.741 --> 18:45.021
it was a health issue on my end.

484
18:45.221 --> 18:45.780
Turns out

485
18:45.860 --> 18:46.701
he put on an act!

486
18:47.181 --> 18:47.661
Yes.

487
18:50.701 --> 18:51.941
Well done, Di Liren.

488
18:53.261 --> 18:54.540
That's truly vicious.

489
18:56.981 --> 18:58.261
From the sound of their voices,

490
18:59.181 --> 19:00.540
that woman was jealous, right?

491
19:02.620 --> 19:03.221
Exactly.

492
19:15.860 --> 19:16.580
Just cry.

493
19:16.820 --> 19:17.741
Cry my foot!

494
19:19.221 --> 19:20.140
I'm not crying.

495
19:21.501 --> 19:22.941
Di Liren is shameless.

496
19:23.140 --> 19:24.340
He hid it so well.

497
19:25.300 --> 19:26.261
Just you wait.

498
19:26.723 --> 19:27.540
One should put trash

499
19:27.620 --> 19:28.580
into the trash can,

500
19:28.901 --> 19:29.501
not study

501
19:29.540 --> 19:30.701
how the trash can works.

502
19:33.901 --> 19:34.461
Exactly.

503
19:35.340 --> 19:35.901
You're right.

504
19:40.741 --> 19:41.860
Di Liren gave me this

505
19:41.860 --> 19:42.981
for our first anniversary.

506
19:43.300 --> 19:43.877
Throw it away.

507
19:45.140 --> 19:46.100
Are you crazy?

508
19:46.981 --> 19:47.661
Why throw away

509
19:47.661 --> 19:48.580
something so expensive?

510
19:50.701 --> 19:51.780
Since he's transferred

511
19:52.181 --> 19:53.140
all our

512
19:53.140 --> 19:53.901
marital assets,

513
19:55.021 --> 19:55.941
sell it for me.

514
19:56.580 --> 19:57.540
I need some cash.

515
19:57.820 --> 19:59.300
I don't offer that service.

516
20:04.261 --> 20:04.741
Fine.

517
20:08.461 --> 20:09.300
(Jiao Xu) Bangle sold.

518
20:09.580 --> 20:10.461
Money transferred.

519
20:12.461 --> 20:12.941
(Okay.)

520
20:13.221 --> 20:14.060
(Insurance covered.)

521
20:16.380 --> 20:17.661
(Jiao Xu) Plus your livestream income,

522
20:17.780 --> 20:19.300
you can finally support yourself.

523
20:19.461 --> 20:20.421
Why not go shopping

524
20:20.501 --> 20:21.100
to celebrate?

525
20:32.421 --> 20:32.901
Hello?

526
20:33.060 --> 20:33.701
Mr. Jiao,

527
20:34.100 --> 20:35.100
you are enjoying

528
20:35.140 --> 20:36.181
my misery,

529
20:36.181 --> 20:36.820
aren't you?

530
20:37.340 --> 20:39.021
I'm cutting expenses here.

531
20:39.221 --> 20:40.261
Go shopping?

532
20:40.261 --> 20:41.021
My goal right now

533
20:41.021 --> 20:42.060
is catching that cheater.

534
20:42.300 --> 20:42.941
And tennis.

535
20:44.300 --> 20:45.580
I know your tennis coach.

536
20:45.701 --> 20:46.181
My client

537
20:46.181 --> 20:47.221
is also training with him.

538
20:47.461 --> 20:49.221
National certification, 900 yuan a session,

539
20:49.461 --> 20:49.901
right?

540
20:50.340 --> 20:51.060
Oh, right!

541
20:51.741 --> 20:52.620
I have tennis lessons

542
20:52.661 --> 20:53.261
to be refunded.

543
20:54.300 --> 20:55.100
I charged that much

544
20:55.100 --> 20:56.461
only because of him.

545
20:57.860 --> 20:58.620
Forget about him.

546
20:59.140 --> 20:59.620
Bad luck.

547
21:00.181 --> 21:00.780
I need to go.

548
21:05.501 --> 21:06.224
Morning, Mr. Jiao.

549
21:13.663 --> 21:14.580
You're the only client

550
21:14.701 --> 21:15.300
who always

551
21:15.340 --> 21:16.461
arrives earlier than me.

552
21:17.580 --> 21:18.901
That's because I'm more anxious

553
21:18.901 --> 21:19.620
than anyone else.

554
21:21.221 --> 21:21.860
Tell me.

555
21:22.501 --> 21:23.221
What's the plan?

556
21:24.300 --> 21:25.380
Before we talk business,

557
21:26.021 --> 21:26.941
let me bribe

558
21:26.941 --> 21:28.340
my divorce attorney.

559
21:29.901 --> 21:30.901
A little gift for you.

560
21:34.261 --> 21:35.540
This diffuser smells amazing.

561
21:35.981 --> 21:37.620
It's soothing and calming.

562
21:39.060 --> 21:39.860
Besides,

563
21:39.981 --> 21:41.060
I buy their seasonal drop

564
21:41.060 --> 21:41.981
every year.

565
21:42.421 --> 21:43.181
You should try it.

566
21:47.221 --> 21:49.181
I hate spending money on things

567
21:49.501 --> 21:50.941
that just burn away.

568
21:51.820 --> 21:53.221
That's why your taste

569
21:53.221 --> 21:54.261
needs an upgrade.

570
21:55.140 --> 21:56.941
Then start

571
21:56.941 --> 21:57.461
by getting me

572
21:57.461 --> 21:58.860
a more comfortable chair.

573
21:59.300 --> 22:00.860
My butt went numb waiting for you.

574
22:01.140 --> 22:01.820
Could it be

575
22:01.820 --> 22:02.941
that I did it on purpose

576
22:03.741 --> 22:04.620
so my clients

577
22:04.620 --> 22:05.941
don't get too comfortable

578
22:06.100 --> 22:06.901
and refuse to leave?

579
22:09.501 --> 22:10.461
Okay, down to business.

580
22:12.461 --> 22:13.701
We're just one spark away

581
22:14.901 --> 22:16.300
from catching them red-handed.

582
22:16.501 --> 22:17.340
Where do you plan

583
22:17.580 --> 22:18.461
to light that spark?

584
22:29.261 --> 22:29.860
Mr. Di.

585
22:32.580 --> 22:33.181
In a bit,

586
22:33.380 --> 22:34.300
go to the gallery

587
22:35.501 --> 22:36.380
and hand this check

588
22:36.540 --> 22:37.461
to Mr. Wang.

589
22:37.741 --> 22:38.100
Okay.

590
22:38.261 --> 22:39.060
I won't be going.

591
22:40.780 --> 22:41.380
Mr. Wang,

592
22:41.380 --> 22:42.580
we should meet at the gallery.

593
22:42.580 --> 22:43.261
Why are you here?

594
22:43.421 --> 22:44.421
If I went to the gallery,

595
22:44.580 --> 22:46.540
could I meet Jiali's Mr. Di?

596
22:48.580 --> 22:49.701
This is for you.

597
22:56.340 --> 22:56.941
Mr. Di.

598
22:59.780 --> 23:00.340
Do you have

599
23:00.340 --> 23:01.421
anything else for me?

600
23:01.820 --> 23:02.860
Not much, really.

601
23:03.780 --> 23:04.901
I just want to meet

602
23:05.461 --> 23:06.501
the boss of Chuangyi.

603
23:08.140 --> 23:09.461
I don't know what you mean.

604
23:09.661 --> 23:10.461
Playing dumb now

605
23:10.580 --> 23:11.461
won't do you any good.

606
23:13.741 --> 23:14.860
Chuangyi is yours, right?

607
23:16.580 --> 23:17.181
Look.

608
23:17.941 --> 23:18.701
Give me

609
23:18.741 --> 23:20.100
another 1 million in compensation.

610
23:21.501 --> 23:22.100
Otherwise,

611
23:22.580 --> 23:23.340
you can imagine

612
23:23.780 --> 23:25.021
what scandal I'll stir up

613
23:25.461 --> 23:26.421
around your gallery.

614
23:27.380 --> 23:28.661
Use your imagination.

615
23:29.140 --> 23:30.701
You don't need to tell me this.

616
23:31.981 --> 23:32.981
Art transactions

617
23:32.981 --> 23:34.300
are voluntary.

618
23:34.981 --> 23:36.261
We operate legally.

619
23:36.941 --> 23:37.501
Employees

620
23:37.501 --> 23:38.981
might have abused their position,

621
23:39.461 --> 23:40.820
but it has nothing to do with me.

622
23:40.981 --> 23:42.140
Mr. Wang, your demand

623
23:42.140 --> 23:42.901
is unreasonable,

624
23:43.620 --> 23:45.300
and there is no legal basis for it.

625
23:46.701 --> 23:47.140
Fine.

626
23:47.421 --> 23:48.461
Go chat at your company.

627
23:49.501 --> 23:50.580
What? Trying to get rough?

628
23:51.060 --> 23:51.620
Calm down.

629
23:51.620 --> 23:52.140
What are you doing?

630
23:52.140 --> 23:52.992
I'm calling security!

631
23:55.661 --> 23:56.261
Security!

632
23:56.820 --> 23:57.421
Security!

633
23:57.780 --> 23:58.860
Someone's causing trouble!

634
23:58.860 --> 24:00.221
Hit me? Are you out of your mind?

635
24:05.340 --> 24:06.461
Don't actually hit him!

636
24:06.461 --> 24:07.860
Always causing trouble! Quick!

637
24:07.860 --> 24:08.649
What are you doing?

638
24:10.540 --> 24:11.140
Are you okay?

639
24:16.060 --> 24:17.021
Mr. Di, are you okay?

640
24:17.421 --> 24:18.021
I'm fine.

641
24:19.780 --> 24:20.741
Alright, stop looking.

642
24:22.300 --> 24:24.140
How can you say you're fine?

643
24:26.580 --> 24:28.100
There's so much we can do

644
24:28.100 --> 24:28.901
with this injury.

645
24:31.661 --> 24:33.100
Mr. Dong, what do you mean?

646
24:35.820 --> 24:36.261
Hold still.

647
24:43.701 --> 24:44.901
We retouch the photo,

648
24:45.501 --> 24:46.620
exaggerate the damage,

649
24:47.340 --> 24:48.701
and make it look

650
24:49.021 --> 24:50.741
like a severe trauma at first glance,

651
24:51.981 --> 24:53.620
like you're on the brink of death.

652
24:54.501 --> 24:55.620
Then we'll have someone

653
24:55.741 --> 24:56.901
write up an article,

654
24:57.620 --> 24:59.140
claiming our competitor

655
24:59.140 --> 25:00.100
tried to derail

656
25:00.100 --> 25:01.340
Jiali's new product launch

657
25:01.901 --> 25:03.100
by fabricating smear campaigns

658
25:03.100 --> 25:03.941
against us.

659
25:04.181 --> 25:05.300
Under these circumstances,

660
25:05.421 --> 25:06.461
a Jiali senior executive

661
25:06.501 --> 25:07.941
stepped up to confront them

662
25:08.340 --> 25:10.060
only to get beaten in broad daylight,

663
25:10.461 --> 25:11.620
and is now comatose,

664
25:12.060 --> 25:13.300
getting treatment in the ICU.

665
25:16.100 --> 25:17.580
That way, we can naturally

666
25:17.780 --> 25:19.300
cover up Jiali's recent scandals

667
25:19.300 --> 25:19.780
in the media

668
25:20.140 --> 25:21.261
and win some sympathy.

669
25:22.100 --> 25:23.380
To pull this off,

670
25:23.741 --> 25:25.380
you'll have to stay in the hospital

671
25:25.421 --> 25:26.221
for a few more days.

672
25:28.968 --> 25:29.768
(Breaking News: Jiali Executive beaten unconscious)

673
25:29.768 --> 25:30.440
(Jiali insider reveals clear source behind recent scandals.)

674
25:30.440 --> 25:31.176
(Our legal team has gathered evidence of malicious rumors.)

675
25:31.176 --> 25:31.784
(Mr. Di only agreed to meet them after repeated provocations)

676
25:31.784 --> 25:32.488
(to stop unfair competition in person, never expecting a violent attack.)

677
25:35.400 --> 25:36.232
Hold on a second.

678
25:39.221 --> 25:40.060
One short. No good.

679
25:40.060 --> 25:40.540
No.

680
25:41.300 --> 25:42.021
Did you see that?

681
25:42.021 --> 25:42.741
He saw your cards!

682
25:42.741 --> 25:43.404
Three of a kind.

683
25:44.860 --> 25:45.501
Three of a kind.

684
25:45.701 --> 25:47.021
She held them in front of me.

685
25:47.300 --> 25:48.100
No...

686
25:48.221 --> 25:48.981
I didn't.

687
25:49.032 --> 25:49.832
Not your turn yet.

688
25:53.672 --> 25:56.461
(Liren)

689
25:56.461 --> 25:57.060
Sorry,

690
25:57.380 --> 25:59.421
the number you dialed is powered off.

691
25:59.661 --> 26:01.060
Please try again later.

692
26:10.340 --> 26:11.021
Sorry,

693
26:11.340 --> 26:13.380
(Liren) the number you dialed is powered off.

694
26:13.501 --> 26:14.620
Please try again...

695
26:25.820 --> 26:27.181
Dinner's ready. Wash up and eat.

696
26:27.901 --> 26:28.421
Alright.

697
26:28.421 --> 26:28.981
Okay.

698
26:29.221 --> 26:30.060
Flip them over here.

699
26:30.060 --> 26:30.501
Okay.

700
26:30.780 --> 26:32.060
Taste our home cooking.

701
26:32.780 --> 26:33.380
Smells great.

702
26:33.661 --> 26:34.181
Come on.

703
26:34.501 --> 26:35.661
Have some soup first.

704
26:36.140 --> 26:36.661
Okay.

705
26:37.860 --> 26:38.620
Okay, enough.

706
26:38.620 --> 26:39.620
Liu Zi, give it to me.

707
26:39.780 --> 26:40.620
I'll do it myself.

708
26:40.620 --> 26:41.701
Alright, help yourself.

709
26:44.060 --> 26:45.300
Quite a feast today.

710
26:45.380 --> 26:46.340
Yeah, we have shrimp.

711
26:46.580 --> 26:47.060
Okay.

712
26:49.860 --> 26:50.340
Mr. Yu,

713
26:50.340 --> 26:51.181
may I take a day off?

714
26:51.580 --> 26:52.181
I just noticed

715
26:52.261 --> 26:53.580
the Rasagiline pills in the box

716
26:53.661 --> 26:54.461
got a bit damp.

717
26:54.701 --> 26:55.741
I want to go to the clinic

718
26:55.741 --> 26:56.661
to get you a refill,

719
26:57.181 --> 26:58.100
so they work right.

720
26:58.261 --> 26:58.941
Sure.

721
26:59.661 --> 27:00.901
You're always so thoughtful.

722
27:01.021 --> 27:02.140
Hurry back, then.

723
27:02.140 --> 27:02.860
Will do.

724
27:03.221 --> 27:04.021
Enjoy your meal.

725
27:04.021 --> 27:04.620
Okay.

726
27:04.741 --> 27:05.580
Thanks, Ms. Hui.

727
27:06.888 --> 27:10.920
(Outpatient)

728
27:14.860 --> 27:15.780
Stop watching.

729
27:16.501 --> 27:17.540
He's putting on an act.

730
27:18.181 --> 27:18.901
Still, he was once

731
27:18.941 --> 27:20.021
the man you slept with.

732
27:20.261 --> 27:21.380
Don't you feel any sympathy?

733
27:21.964 --> 27:22.701
Aren't you afraid

734
27:22.701 --> 27:23.820
the people you sent

735
27:23.981 --> 27:25.021
might've hit him so hard

736
27:25.140 --> 27:26.004
he got hospitalized?

737
27:26.140 --> 27:27.221
I only encouraged them

738
27:27.221 --> 27:28.380
to fight for their right

739
27:28.380 --> 27:29.661
to return their purchases.

740
27:30.380 --> 27:32.261
I never hired anyone to beat him up.

741
27:32.780 --> 27:34.221
That just proves Di Liren

742
27:34.221 --> 27:35.620
has one of those punchable faces.

743
27:38.021 --> 27:38.661
By the way,

744
27:39.421 --> 27:40.421
that Mr. Dong

745
27:40.901 --> 27:41.901
won't mess up, right?

746
27:42.540 --> 27:43.221
Of course.

747
27:43.661 --> 27:44.701
Even though Mr. Dong

748
27:44.701 --> 27:46.060
doesn't know what I'm up to,

749
27:46.221 --> 27:47.860
he'll always side with me

750
27:48.100 --> 27:49.060
over Liren.

751
27:49.540 --> 27:51.461
You're going all out with the outfit?

752
27:51.901 --> 27:52.820
Of course.

753
27:53.100 --> 27:54.380
For such a big occasion,

754
27:54.501 --> 27:56.021
I need a full face of makeup

755
27:56.300 --> 27:57.100
to hold the fort.

756
27:58.741 --> 27:59.380
Alright.

757
28:00.620 --> 28:01.380
(Outpatient) Don't worry.

758
28:01.540 --> 28:03.021
I've handled everything else.

759
28:03.421 --> 28:04.261
I already had Liu Zi

760
28:04.261 --> 28:05.060
play cards

761
28:05.060 --> 28:06.261
with my parents,

762
28:06.540 --> 28:07.620
so they won't use phones.

763
28:09.140 --> 28:10.860
I'm terrified my dad might see this

764
28:11.221 --> 28:12.181
and get angina again.

765
28:13.461 --> 28:14.461
Very thorough.

766
28:15.340 --> 28:16.780
Out of all my cases,

767
28:16.820 --> 28:18.261
you snap out of it the fastest.

768
28:22.701 --> 28:24.100
Isn't that eyeliner

769
28:24.580 --> 28:25.901
winged out a bit too much?

770
28:29.100 --> 28:29.661
Isn't it nice?

771
28:31.860 --> 28:32.901
You look intimidating.

772
28:33.540 --> 28:34.421
That's right.

773
28:35.140 --> 28:36.701
A true boss lady's wings

774
28:36.860 --> 28:38.221
always reach for the sky.

775
28:38.501 --> 28:39.300
That's great.

776
28:39.340 --> 28:40.221
No need to take a cab.

777
28:40.340 --> 28:41.701
You can reach far for free.

778
28:42.461 --> 28:43.461
I can give you a kick

779
28:43.461 --> 28:44.780
for a free ride too.

780
28:46.181 --> 28:47.941
I'd feel a bit embarrassed.

781
28:48.060 --> 28:49.140
The firm reimburses

782
28:49.140 --> 28:50.021
our cab fares anyway.

783
28:50.140 --> 28:51.421
I can't just take this for free.

784
28:54.060 --> 28:55.701
Oh, I'd gladly take it.

785
28:56.421 --> 28:57.941
Since you don't want freebies,

786
28:57.941 --> 28:59.060
hand over

787
28:59.060 --> 28:59.941
that insurance claim

788
28:59.981 --> 29:01.060
from when you scratched

789
29:01.140 --> 29:01.780
my car.

790
29:02.021 --> 29:03.021
Now I see

791
29:03.060 --> 29:04.340
why your streams are so popular.

792
29:04.461 --> 29:05.380
Such a massive market

793
29:05.501 --> 29:06.380
for masochists.

794
29:07.261 --> 29:08.140
Two... No.

795
29:08.300 --> 29:09.701
I mean, Ms. Yu.

796
29:10.340 --> 29:11.860
So we're just gonna wait here

797
29:12.421 --> 29:13.140
for them to come?

798
29:13.421 --> 29:14.021
She could

799
29:14.021 --> 29:15.380
cancel Di Liren's deposit

800
29:15.380 --> 29:17.021
at a moment's notice.

801
29:17.261 --> 29:18.901
That shows their financial ties

802
29:19.060 --> 29:20.501
run far deeper

803
29:20.501 --> 29:21.221
than we thought.

804
29:21.661 --> 29:23.221
Regardless of feelings, just for money,

805
29:23.421 --> 29:24.620
she'll come check if Liren

806
29:24.620 --> 29:25.461
is dead or alive.

807
29:25.741 --> 29:27.060
In a crowd this big,

808
29:27.100 --> 29:28.540
how do we know who she is

809
29:28.741 --> 29:29.620
or if she even came?

810
29:36.701 --> 29:37.221
Finger heart?

811
29:37.901 --> 29:39.380
Heart my foot.

812
29:39.620 --> 29:41.860
I mean I've got this in the bag.

813
29:42.941 --> 29:43.820
I already had Mr. Dong

814
29:43.820 --> 29:44.820
set up the caregiver.

815
29:45.060 --> 29:45.901
If anyone visits,

816
29:46.140 --> 29:47.221
he'll notify me right away.

817
30:22.300 --> 30:22.941
Mr. Di.

818
30:28.421 --> 30:29.421
What are you doing here?

819
30:31.661 --> 30:32.540
Are you hurt badly?

820
30:33.661 --> 30:34.741
Just minor scratches.

821
30:35.741 --> 30:36.540
Why?

822
30:38.221 --> 30:39.021
I'm hospitalized.

823
30:39.580 --> 30:40.820
Yu Meng has to show up, right?

824
30:41.540 --> 30:42.780
When I heard the door earlier,

825
30:42.901 --> 30:43.941
I thought it was her.

826
30:44.140 --> 30:45.221
I didn't expect you.

827
30:45.820 --> 30:46.860
I called you.

828
30:47.620 --> 30:48.372
You didn't answer.

829
30:48.580 --> 30:49.540
My phone broke.

830
30:51.375 --> 30:52.380
What about her parents?

831
30:52.380 --> 30:53.267
Why haven't they come?

832
30:55.741 --> 30:57.060
Liu Zi came over today

833
30:57.580 --> 30:58.780
to play cards with them.

834
30:59.340 --> 31:00.380
Phones untouched all day.

835
31:00.461 --> 31:01.661
They don't know you're hurt.

836
31:06.221 --> 31:07.060
Something's off.

837
31:10.100 --> 31:10.941
You should head back.

838
31:11.901 --> 31:13.140
You shouldn't be here.

839
31:14.181 --> 31:15.221
Don't worry.

840
31:16.140 --> 31:17.580
Without an ironclad excuse,

841
31:18.300 --> 31:19.901
I wouldn't risk coming here.

842
31:33.981 --> 31:35.181
You're worried about me?

843
31:42.701 --> 31:43.941
These calluses on your hands

844
31:44.421 --> 31:45.461
are getting thicker.

845
31:45.860 --> 31:46.461
Yeah.

846
31:47.901 --> 31:49.100
If you really died,

847
31:50.340 --> 31:51.620
my last few years'd be wasted.

848
31:54.021 --> 31:55.300
Don't talk nonsense.

849
31:59.976 --> 32:02.536
♪I've seen this game before♪

850
32:03.100 --> 32:04.421
(A female visitor came.)

851
32:05.256 --> 32:07.592
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

852
32:08.040 --> 32:10.824
♪Just an empty shell♪

853
32:11.112 --> 32:13.896
♪I've broken this game before♪

854
32:13.896 --> 32:16.296
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

855
32:16.296 --> 32:18.504
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

856
32:18.632 --> 32:23.240
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

857
32:23.240 --> 32:24.228
(A female visitor came.)

858
32:26.184 --> 32:28.968
♪For the part you owe me♪

859
32:28.968 --> 32:34.888
♪I'll make you pay double♪

860
32:37.140 --> 32:37.941
Meng,

861
32:38.701 --> 32:39.701
you're finally back!

862
32:39.981 --> 32:41.021
Your parents were worried.

863
32:41.100 --> 32:42.261
They looked everywhere.

864
32:44.100 --> 32:44.860
This is Ms. Hui,

865
32:45.421 --> 32:46.501
my parents' housekeeper.

866
32:47.461 --> 32:48.181
This is Liu Bai.

867
32:51.181 --> 32:51.780
Hello.

868
32:52.261 --> 32:52.820
Hello.

869
32:52.981 --> 32:53.501
Ms. Hui,

870
32:54.100 --> 32:54.981
what brings you here?

871
32:56.540 --> 32:57.501
I came to pick up

872
32:58.380 --> 32:59.060
(Rasagiline Mesylate Tablets) two boxes of pills for your dad.

873
32:59.661 --> 33:01.060
His old ones got damp.

874
33:01.421 --> 33:02.421
I bumped into Zhang Tao

875
33:02.500 --> 33:03.622
getting medicine for Mr. Di,

876
33:03.780 --> 33:04.661
so I came visit him.

877
33:07.340 --> 33:07.981
Honey,

878
33:08.380 --> 33:09.221
I'm hurt.

879
33:09.981 --> 33:10.421
Come on.

880
33:10.741 --> 33:11.620
Let's talk outside.

881
33:16.340 --> 33:17.181
Why are you here too?

882
33:17.701 --> 33:19.248
My sister's afraid you'd get bullied.

883
33:27.701 --> 33:28.261
Ms. Hui,

884
33:28.820 --> 33:30.580
while you were here,

885
33:30.941 --> 33:31.701
did anyone else

886
33:31.701 --> 33:32.461
come visit him?

887
33:32.860 --> 33:34.261
A nurse checked his blood pressure.

888
33:34.981 --> 33:36.941
Besides nurses or doctors,

889
33:37.060 --> 33:38.100
no one else?

890
33:38.941 --> 33:39.620
No.

891
33:41.461 --> 33:43.140
How long were you inside?

892
33:43.540 --> 33:45.021
In the half hour I was there,

893
33:45.741 --> 33:47.021
no one else walked in.

894
33:47.701 --> 33:48.741
Is something wrong?

895
33:49.620 --> 33:50.181
Nothing.

896
33:50.860 --> 33:51.661
The aide talked

897
33:51.661 --> 33:52.421
to the nurse.

898
33:52.620 --> 33:53.380
No strangers.

899
33:53.540 --> 33:54.221
Don't worry.

900
33:55.380 --> 33:56.780
Be careful on your way

901
33:56.780 --> 33:57.300
home.

902
33:57.340 --> 33:57.661
Okay.

903
33:57.981 --> 33:58.701
I'll be going now.

904
33:58.901 --> 33:59.300
Bye-bye.

905
33:59.461 --> 33:59.941
Bye-bye.

906
34:06.820 --> 34:07.461
Can you take

907
34:07.461 --> 34:08.540
both of them on alone?

908
34:08.740 --> 34:09.501
(Jiao Xu) I'll go help you.

909
34:10.060 --> 34:11.381
Don't worry. No extra charge.

910
34:13.740 --> 34:14.301
Wrong person.

911
34:14.781 --> 34:15.341
Missed.

912
34:29.461 --> 34:30.461
Honey,

913
34:30.660 --> 34:32.060
I feel so dizzy.

914
34:32.421 --> 34:34.220
Where I was hit hurts so bad.

915
34:35.501 --> 34:36.461
It's so serious.

916
34:37.180 --> 34:38.180
Could it be a concussion

917
34:38.180 --> 34:39.060
and you're dying?

918
34:39.580 --> 34:40.540
I'll go get the nurse.

919
34:42.260 --> 34:43.060
Honey,

920
34:43.620 --> 34:45.140
it's not actually that bad.

921
34:45.540 --> 34:46.220
Look.

922
34:46.781 --> 34:48.180
It's a glucose drip.

923
34:48.301 --> 34:49.060
If not that bad,

924
34:49.060 --> 34:49.901
why make

925
34:49.901 --> 34:50.501
such a fuss?

926
34:50.660 --> 34:51.700
My parents would freak out

927
34:51.700 --> 34:52.603
if they saw the news.

928
34:54.421 --> 34:55.060
Sit down.

929
34:57.100 --> 34:58.381
It was Mr. Dong's idea.

930
34:58.861 --> 34:59.941
I thought it made sense.

931
35:00.381 --> 35:01.021
First,

932
35:01.461 --> 35:03.381
it eases public pressure on the company

933
35:03.700 --> 35:04.861
by shifting the focus

934
35:05.100 --> 35:06.540
to corporate rivalry.

935
35:07.501 --> 35:08.220
Second,

936
35:08.941 --> 35:10.461
I knew you were mad at me

937
35:10.580 --> 35:11.580
and vanished on purpose.

938
35:12.060 --> 35:12.941
I had to see you

939
35:13.060 --> 35:14.501
to apologize properly, right?

940
35:14.941 --> 35:16.620
So you banked on me showing up.

941
35:18.580 --> 35:19.421
Honey,

942
35:20.540 --> 35:21.821
where did you go?

943
35:22.461 --> 35:23.100
Mr. Di.

944
35:23.821 --> 35:24.740
- Mr. Di. - Mr. Di.

945
35:24.821 --> 35:25.540
We're here!

946
35:25.620 --> 35:26.140
They insisted

947
35:26.301 --> 35:27.059
on visiting you.

948
35:27.180 --> 35:28.100
Heard your phone broke,

949
35:28.381 --> 35:29.421
so we brought you a spare.

950
35:29.901 --> 35:30.700
Mrs. Di is here!

951
35:31.140 --> 35:32.180
- Hello, Mrs. Di. - Hello, Mrs. Di.

952
35:32.421 --> 35:33.100
That wasn't easy.

953
35:33.381 --> 35:33.821
Mr. Di,

954
35:33.981 --> 35:34.660
you finally

955
35:34.700 --> 35:35.260
won her back!

956
35:35.461 --> 35:36.861
We brought a fruit basket.

957
35:37.140 --> 35:37.580
Mrs. Di,

958
35:37.740 --> 35:39.660
make Mr. Di kneel on a durian

959
35:39.781 --> 35:40.501
to show sincerity.

960
35:40.501 --> 35:41.580
Mr. Di's injured already!

961
35:41.620 --> 35:42.421
You let them come?

962
35:42.540 --> 35:44.021
They were worried about you.

963
35:44.301 --> 35:45.060
Just a scrape.

964
35:45.421 --> 35:46.021
It's nothing.

965
35:46.381 --> 35:47.140
Then I'll do

966
35:47.140 --> 35:47.981
a brief report.

967
35:48.660 --> 35:49.301
Mrs. Di,

968
35:49.540 --> 35:50.620
- Mr. Di has had it rough - Yeah, please forgive him.

969
35:50.620 --> 35:51.580
- these days. - Exactly.

970
35:51.781 --> 35:52.861
Please forgive him.

971
35:53.021 --> 35:54.341
Alright, quiet down.

972
35:55.821 --> 35:56.580
Keep this up,

973
35:56.901 --> 35:58.140
and she will get mad again.

974
36:01.821 --> 36:02.540
Honey,

975
36:02.981 --> 36:03.861
I'm so sorry.

976
36:05.301 --> 36:06.861
This time, I truly realize

977
36:06.861 --> 36:07.660
where I went wrong.

978
36:07.941 --> 36:08.821
It's my fault.

979
36:09.220 --> 36:10.180
I shouldn't have drunk,

980
36:11.341 --> 36:12.540
nor should I have assumed

981
36:12.540 --> 36:13.381
you were at the inn

982
36:13.981 --> 36:15.501
instead of looking for you right away.

983
36:16.341 --> 36:16.941
All my fault.

984
36:18.660 --> 36:19.941
Give me one more chance,

985
36:20.220 --> 36:21.461
and I'll make it right.

986
36:36.740 --> 36:37.461
You're back.

987
36:40.941 --> 36:41.861
Where are my parents?

988
36:42.341 --> 36:43.140
Downstairs.

989
36:43.660 --> 36:45.060
They saw the news

990
36:45.260 --> 36:46.421
and worried you got kidnapped

991
36:46.501 --> 36:47.341
over a corporate war.

992
36:47.381 --> 36:48.341
Have they been watching

993
36:48.540 --> 36:49.260
some soap operas

994
36:49.260 --> 36:50.060
lately?

995
36:50.220 --> 36:50.740
I don't know.

996
36:51.381 --> 36:52.580
Di Liren called them to say

997
36:52.660 --> 36:53.260
he was fine,

998
36:53.381 --> 36:54.580
so they finally relaxed.

999
36:56.781 --> 36:58.501
He wasn't letting them know he's safe.

1000
36:58.861 --> 37:00.421
He tried to keep his good-guy image.

1001
37:01.180 --> 37:02.341
To my parents,

1002
37:02.381 --> 37:03.220
he's a good man,

1003
37:03.540 --> 37:04.501
and I'm

1004
37:04.580 --> 37:05.140
unreasonable.

1005
37:05.901 --> 37:06.540
Meng!

1006
37:07.580 --> 37:08.220
- Meng! - Meng,

1007
37:08.421 --> 37:10.180
you finally decided to come home!

1008
37:10.501 --> 37:11.501
You didn't answer calls

1009
37:11.620 --> 37:12.620
or texts.

1010
37:12.821 --> 37:13.901
We were worried sick!

1011
37:14.501 --> 37:15.301
Thank goodness

1012
37:15.341 --> 37:16.781
Liren called us ahead of time.

1013
37:17.021 --> 37:18.421
He's hospitalized, you're missing.

1014
37:18.620 --> 37:19.781
What were we supposed to do?

1015
37:20.781 --> 37:22.180
What's wrong with you?

1016
37:24.700 --> 37:26.100
I will forgive you just this once.

1017
37:28.021 --> 37:29.660
No matter what happens,

1018
37:29.740 --> 37:30.901
you can't just leave

1019
37:31.060 --> 37:32.060
without a word.

1020
37:34.620 --> 37:36.301
Talk to me when things go wrong.

1021
37:36.501 --> 37:37.740
I will handle it for you.

1022
37:38.861 --> 37:41.021
I know, Dad.

1023
37:41.461 --> 37:42.700
I know, Mom.

1024
37:42.901 --> 37:44.580
I'll tell you everything from now on.

1025
37:46.941 --> 37:48.220
It's good to be home.

1026
37:49.021 --> 37:50.021
You scared us to death.

1027
37:50.540 --> 37:51.821
Don't run off like that again.

1028
37:52.301 --> 37:53.260
We worried sick.

1029
37:56.781 --> 37:58.620
Are you still planning to tell

1030
37:58.861 --> 37:59.341
your parents

1031
